  "system": {
    "description": "<p><i><em style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">(Select the randomly chosen spell(s) in the owner's Spell Selection menu.)</em></i></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">[[/r d8#Orb of Many Energies]]{Roll a d8} to determine its starting color. Each color corresponds to a Spell, which the Bound Being can Cast as long as the orb is that color by spending a Charge.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Whenever you Cast a Spell that corresponds to the orb's current color, roll a d8 to determine its new color.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">1: Red (Burn)</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">2: Orange (Amplify)</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">3. Yellow (Zap)</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">4: Green (Sprout)</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">5: Blue (Freeze)</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">6: Indigo (Ward)</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">7: Violet (Color)</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">8: The orb becomes two colors at once. [[/r 2d8rr8]]{Roll twice, rerolling 8s}. When you Cast a Spell corresponding to either of these colors, you may Cast the Spell corresponding to the other color as a part of the same Action.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">The orb has [[/r Cd6#Orb Charges]]{Cd6} Charges. When it runs out of Charges, it dims to a grayish color and can't be used until the next dawn.</span></p>",
